{
  "about": "Official examples, each pinned to the commit its release tag pointed to on 2026-09-30. 'block' selects the first python code block after a Markdown heading; 'rst_after' selects the indented block that starts at a line in a reStructuredText page, after the 'rst_section' heading when one is given.",
  "example": [
